Subject: [PATCH] Show native allowances and read OpenCode Quota exports directly

Downstream Devario patch for Zed 1.26.2.
OpenCode Quota supplies a local v3 JSON export; stock OpenCode is sufficient.
No private ACP extension or companion OpenCode patch is required.
See README for setup and validation.

